codex
Crediting only the contracted rate moves the N=24 optimum to `8+8+8` under both rules. With fixed costs removed, it moves to six beams of four users. An interior optimum remains, but the favored occupancy depends on the numerator. Of the eight SEALED off-axis switches, seven also come from the cap filter; only one is an efficiency-driven switch, worth 0.831%.
